    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valse des Fleurs is an RPG Maker horror game that takes place in a ballet academy. You take on the role of Anya, a talented ballerina on her first day at the academy whose main goal is to perfect her dancing skills. However, as soon as Anya arrives at the school, she starts having nightmares involving witch-like figures, brainwashed students, and obscene rituals. Now she must find out whether these nightmares are only in her head... or if there is any truth to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740660/extras/1c18713b1b4c2e5f62d86d15f9a838c3.avif?t=1750248726\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious witch-like figures patrolling the academy late at night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stamina system which must be observed before Anya runs out of breath</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A panic meter which must be kept in check for the sake of Anya's sanity</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by horror fans</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740660/extras/df4ebd4f9d01aaa6b2bca8aa81fa1853.avif?t=1750248726\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740660/extras/ec3f9c99a091cfa8cdd57b6e9d02ff07.avif?t=1750248726\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p>",
